WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.236 line:92%
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:04.304 size:84% position:42% line:92%
That's so good to hear.

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:05.038 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:08.575
House Republicans voted toda
to remove GOP conference chair

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
Liz Cheney from
her leadership position,

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:13.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
but they're already claiming
it never happened.

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:14.681 line:92%
After Congresswoman Liz Cheney

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
was voted out
of her leadership position

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:19.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
former President Trump
mocked her on his website,

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:21.921 size:84% position:42%
saying, "I look forward
to soon watching her

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:26.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
as a paid contributor
on CNN or MSDNC,"

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:27.627 size:88% position:44% line:92%
said the business genius

00:00:27.627 --> 00:00:30.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
who calls into Fox News
every day for free.

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:32.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
Liz Cheney told reporters toda
that she plans to do

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:35.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
everything she can to make sur
former President Trump

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:38.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
"never gets anywhere near
the Oval Office."

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:39.839 line:92%
Oh, you know what you could do

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:40.874 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Elect him.

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:41.975 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Former President Trump's

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:43.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
acting Defense Secretary
Christopher Miller

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:47.180
testified today before Congres
about the Pentagon's respons

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the January 6th
Capitol attack

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:52.318 align:start size:94% position:6%
and said he was concerned
that sending troops

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:54.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
would make it look like
a military coup,

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:55.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
as opposed to what
it did look like --

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:59.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
Free Donut Day at the
Krispy Kreme in Middle Earth

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:03.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
A rare deep-sea creature
called a Pacific Football Fish

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:06.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
washed up on a Southern
California beach last week

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:10.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it already has
a Netflix special.

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:12.372 align:start size:94% position:6%
Kentucky Derby winner
Medina Spirit

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:15.542
will be allowed to compete
this weekend in the Preaknes

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:16.776 line:92%
despite failing a drug test.

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:18.578 line:92%
The horse will be in stall 6

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:21.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
next to
my middle school bus driver.

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:23.917 align:start size:94% position:6%
According to a new survey,
people in the Northeast

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:25.085 line:92%
were the most likely to use Zoom

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:26.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
to communicate
a pandemic breakup.

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:30.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
In fact, they even
made it a feature.

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:33.460 align:start size:94% position:6%
A Swedish robotics company
recently unveiled

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:37.897
a battery-operated glove
that can protect factory workers

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:42.235
from chronic injury caused
by repetitive manual tasks

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:47.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Tell me more,"
said teenage boys.

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:49.142 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Tell me more,"

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:54.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
famously a catchphrase
of our nation's teenagers.

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:56.182 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Tell me more."

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:58.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally,
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo

00:01:58.885 --> 00:01:59.586 line:92%
announced plans this week

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:02.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
to roll out pop-up
coronavirus vaccination site

00:02:02.722 --> 00:02:04.457 line:92%
at trains and subway stations,

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:05.492 align:start size:94% position:6%
because you're not
a real New Yorker

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:08.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
until you've been poked
by a needle on the subway.

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:11.998 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that, you guys,
was the monologue.

